@startuml
!theme plain
title SMS Registration Use Case — Public Educational Sequence
actor "Mobile User" as User
participant "Mobile App" as UI
participant "Registration Service" as Auth
participant "SMS Delivery Provider" as SMS
database "User Store" as Store
User -> UI : Select Register / enter number
UI -> Auth : Request verification(phone)
Auth -> Auth : Validate number / apply rate limit
Auth -> SMS : Send short-lived code
SMS --> User : SMS code
User -> UI : Enter received code
UI -> Auth : Verify(code, challengeId)
alt Valid code
  Auth -> Store : Atomic find/create user
  Store --> Auth : User reference
  Auth --> UI : Session / success
  UI --> User : Open home screen
else Invalid or expired code
  Auth --> UI : Invalid / expired / throttled
  UI --> User : Explain and offer controlled retry
end
@enduml